<title>USA: Quaker Oats CEO got 2 pct raise, no bonus in'96.</title>
<headline>Quaker Oats CEO got 2 pct raise, no bonus in'96.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quaker Oats Co chief executive officer William Smithburg received a two percent raise and no bonus in 1996, according to the company's proxy statement for its annual shareholder meeting.</p>
<p>Smithburg received $872,506 in salary, up two percent form the previous year, the proxy said.</p>
<p>Smithburg did not receive a bonus in either year, the proxy said.</p>
<p>The chief executive officer also exercised 79,312 options with realized value of $1.7 million, the proxy said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
